{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02424",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 6.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.36,
      "end_seconds": 11.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.03,
      "end_seconds": 33.02,
      "duration_seconds": 19.99,
      "text": "Honestly, it's sudden severe pain on the right side of my pelvis, and my family pushed me to come. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.8,
      "end_seconds": 38.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.53,
      "end_seconds": 48.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "It's been about two weeks now. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.33,
      "end_seconds": 59.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.51,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.08,
      "end_seconds": 64.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "It's worse with movement. It comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 69.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.42,
      "end_seconds": 89.95,
      "duration_seconds": 19.53,
      "text": "It usually comes with pain that comes in waves. The pain that comes in waves? That's been for three days. Let me think, as for pain that comes in waves, a four out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.26,
      "end_seconds": 93.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Have you been feeling faint?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.41,
      "end_seconds": 96.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.41,
      "end_seconds": 104.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.74,
      "end_seconds": 108.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.33,
      "end_seconds": 115.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "A few quick ones: discharge, missed period, fever or vaginal bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.14,
      "end_seconds": 118.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.44,
      "end_seconds": 122.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.62,
      "end_seconds": 126.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.02,
      "end_seconds": 134.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Alright, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.27,
      "end_seconds": 138.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.29,
      "end_seconds": 142.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.3,
      "end_seconds": 146.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.74,
      "end_seconds": 153.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.56,
      "end_seconds": 162.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.38,
      "end_seconds": 168.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.66,
      "end_seconds": 170.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.07,
      "end_seconds": 174.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.94,
      "end_seconds": 178.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.65,
      "end_seconds": 181.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.27,
      "end_seconds": 185.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.54,
      "end_seconds": 201.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.3,
      "end_seconds": 205.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.08,
      "end_seconds": 216.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.81,
      "end_seconds": 221.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.85,
      "end_seconds": 225.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.12,
      "end_seconds": 240.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.41,
      "end_seconds": 266.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.6 degrees, pressure 135 over 76, respiratory rate 19, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse is 122 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.29,
      "end_seconds": 269.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.32,
      "end_seconds": 273.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.83,
      "end_seconds": 279.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.82,
      "end_seconds": 298.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.85,
      "end_seconds": 301.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.52,
      "end_seconds": 325.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "You are in severe pain with a tender mass low on the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.82,
      "end_seconds": 329.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.39,
      "end_seconds": 358.26,
      "duration_seconds": 25.87,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, so my impression is this: It's hard to say. Possible ovarian torsion is one possibility and a ruptured cyst another, and I'd rather not commit yet. I think an urgent pelvic ultrasound makes sense here, for possible torsion. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.21,
      "end_seconds": 361.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.72,
      "end_seconds": 374.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a pregnancy test for pelvic pain. You need an emergency scan and probably surgery today. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.71,
      "end_seconds": 378.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.17,
      "end_seconds": 380.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}